
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#087f3e">
  <title>Join OGARS | Choose Your Purpose</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Join OGARS to find work, hire workers, advertise property, register your business, sell products and promote events.">

  <style>
    :root {
      --green: #087f3e;
      --dark-green: #05632f;
      --light-green: #eaf7ee;
      --text: #183126;
      --muted: #63736a;
      --border: #dce9df;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --background: #f5faf6;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: var(--white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .logo {
      color: var(--green);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .home-link {
      color: var(--green);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #087f3e, #075d32);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 48px 20px 54px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: #e8f7ec;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 18px 45px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      font-size: 25px;
      margin: 0 0 7px;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .options-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .option-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(20, 65, 35, 0.04);
      transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }

    .option-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--green);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .option-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--light-green);
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }

    .option-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .option-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .option-button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      padding: 11px 10px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .option-button:hover {
      background: var(--dark-green);
    }

    .help-box {
      background: var(--light-green);
      border: 1px solid #cde8d4;
      border-radius: 13px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .help-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 7px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .help-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #425d4b;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      background: white;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 22px 15px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--green);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    a:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #f2bd45;
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 700px) {
      .options-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .option-card {
        padding: 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 360px) {
      .header-inner {
        padding: 12px;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 21px;
      }

      main {
        padding-left: 12px;
        padding-right: 12px;
      }

      .option-card {
        padding: 14px 11px;
      }

      .option-card h3 {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .option-card p {
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        transition: none !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a class="logo" href="index.html">OGARS</a>
      <a class="home-link" href="index.html">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to OGARS!</h1>
    <p>
      One platform, many opportunities. Tell us what you want to do
      and we will take you to the right place.
    </p>
  </section>

  <main>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>What would you like to do?</h2>
      <p>Choose an option below to get started.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="options-grid">

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">🛠️</div>
        <h3>Find Work as a Skilled Worker</h3>
        <p>Create a worker profile so customers and employers can discover your skills and contact you.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="join.html">Register as a Worker</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">💼</div>
        <h3>Find Employment</h3>
        <p>Explore available jobs and employment opportunities posted on OGARS.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="jobs.html">Find Jobs</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">📢</div>
        <h3>Post a Job Vacancy</h3>
        <p>Are you an employer or company looking for workers? Publish a job opportunity.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="post-job.html">Post a Job</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">🏠</div>
        <h3>Find a Property</h3>
        <p>Search for houses, rooms, apartments, shops, land and other properties.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="find-property.html">Find Property</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">🔑</div>
        <h3>Advertise a Property</h3>
        <p>List a property for rent or sale so interested people can contact you.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="properties.html">Post a Property</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">🏢</div>
        <h3>Register a Business</h3>
        <p>Create a business profile to introduce your services, location and contact details.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="register-business.html">Register Business</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">🛍️</div>
        <h3>Sell Products</h3>
        <p>Showcase products such as food, clothing, electronics and other goods to potential customers.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="register-business.html">Start Selling</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">🚗</div>
        <h3>Drivers & Vehicles</h3>
        <p>Register as a driver, list a vehicle, or find a driver or vehicle for your needs.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="vehicles.html">Explore Options</a>
      </article>

      <article class="option-card">
        <div class="option-icon">📣</div>
        <h3>Advertise or Promote</h3>
        <p>Promote schools, churches, events, training, courses, organizations and special offers.</p>
        <a class="option-button" href="advertise.html">Advertise With OGARS</a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="help-box">
      <h3>Not sure where to start?</h3>
      <p>
        You can return to the homepage to explore all OGARS services.
        Choose the option that matches your needs.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 13px;">
        <a class="option-button" style="max-width: 220px; margin: 0 auto;" href="index.html">
          Explore OGARS Home
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 OGARS Workers Platform. Connecting people, services and opportunities.</p>
    <a href="index.html">Back to Homepage</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
